const List<GeoTopic> spaceTopics = <GeoTopic>[
  GeoTopic(
    id: "solar-system",
    title: "Nizam-e-Shamsi — Suraj aur Aath Siyare",
    subtitle: "Suraj ka khandan, har siyare ka naam, us ke laqab ki wajah, aur paper ke pakke facts",
    portion: "space",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/visual-notes/planets.jpg", caption: "The Solar System at a Glance"),
      LessonBlock.heading("Ye lesson kyun zaroori hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("One paper ka GK wala hissa ho ya Everyday Science ka, Nizam-e-Shamsi se sawal ana tay hai. Sab se bara siyara konsa hai, sab se garam konsa hai, Red Planet kise kehte hain, kis siyare ke sab se zyada chaand hain — ye sawal har doosre paper me ghum phir kar ajate hain. Aur mazay ki baat ye hai ke ye pure number hain, kyunke in ka jawab aik hi hota hai aur wo badalta nahi. Jo student ye lesson samajh kar parh le, wo in sawalon me kabhi nahi atkay ga. Lekin aik shart hai. Naam ke sath wajah bhi samajhni hai. Sirf ye ratna ke Mars Red Planet hai kaafi nahi. Paper kabhi kabhi wajah wale pehlu se bhi phansata hai. Is lesson me har siyare ka naam, us ka laqab, us laqab ki wajah aur us ke paper wale facts, sab sath sath chalenge."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Pehle buniyadi baat samajh lo"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Dekho, raat ko asmaan par jo kuch chamakta hai wo sab aik jesa nahi hota. Kuch cheezain apni roshni khud banati hain, unhe sitara kehte hain. Hamara Suraj aik sitara hai. Aur kuch cheezain khud thandi aur tareek hoti hain, wo kisi sitare ki roshni se chamakti hain aur usi sitare ke gird chakkar lagati hain, unhe siyara kehte hain. Chaand bhi khud tareek hai, wo siyare ke gird ghoomta hai. Bas yehi teen darjay zehen me bitha lo. Sitara sab se bara aur khud roshan, siyara sitare ke gird, aur chaand siyare ke gird."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Hamari Zameen aik siyara hai aur Suraj ke gird ghoomti hai. Suraj ke gird kul aath siyare ghoomte hain, aur is pure khandan ko Nizam-e-Shamsi kehte hain. Shamsi ka matlab hi hai Suraj se taluq rakhne wala. Ab aik aik karke pure khandan se milte hain. Pehle khandan ke sarbarah se, yani Suraj se."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Suraj — hamara sitara"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Sab se pehli aur sab se pakki baat. Suraj siyara nahi hai, sitara hai. Ye hamare Nizam-e-Shamsi ke bilkul darmiyan me hai aur baqi tamam siyare is ke gird chakkar lagate hain. Is ki wajah is ka hajm hai. Pure Nizam-e-Shamsi ke kul wazan ka takreeban tamam hissa, yani 99.86 feesad, akelay Suraj me hai. Baqi aath siyare, un ke chaand, pathar aur gard, sab mil kar bhi aik feesad se kam bante hain. Yehi wajah hai ke Suraj ki kashish sab ko apne gird bandhe rakhti hai, jese aik bara markaz apne chhote sathiyon ko sambhale rakhta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Suraj kitna bara hai, is ka andaza yun lagao. Is ka qutar takreeban 13 lakh 90 hazar kilometre hai, yani Zameen ke qutar se takreeban 109 guna bara. Agar Suraj ko khokhla ghubaara samjho to is ke andar takreeban 13 lakh Zameenein sama sakti hain. Ye aisi misaal hai jo paper me bhi ati hai aur zehen me bhi reh jati hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab sawal ye hai ke Suraj itna garam aur roshan kyun hai. Is ke markaz me hydrogen gas shadeed dabao se helium me badalti rehti hai, aur is amal me bohat zyada tawanai banti hai jo roshni aur garmi ki surat me bahar nikalti hai. Isi liye Suraj ke markaz ka darja-e-hararat takreeban dedh crore degree centigrade hai, jabke is ki satah ka darja takreeban 5,500 degree hai. Suraj ki roshni ko Zameen tak pohnchne me takreeban 8 minute aur 20 second lagte hain. Yani tum jo Suraj dekh rahe ho, wo asal me 8 minute purana manzar hai. Suraj ki umar takreeban 4 arab 60 crore saal hai, aur Zameen par zindagi ki buniyad hi is ki roshni aur garmi hai. Paper ke liye ye lines pakki kar lo: Suraj aik sitara hai, Nizam-e-Shamsi ka markaz hai, sab se bara hissa hai, aur is ki roshni 8 minute se zyada waqt me hum tak pohnchti hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Pehla siyara: Mercury — Utarid"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Suraj se sab se qareeb siyara Mercury hai, jise Urdu me Utarid kehte hain. Ye Nizam-e-Shamsi ka sab se chhota siyara hai, itna chhota ke hamare Chaand se bas thora sa bara hai. Aur ye sab se tez siyara bhi hai. Tez se murad ye hai ke Suraj ke gird is ka chakkar sab se jaldi pura hota hai, sirf 88 din me. Socho, jahan Zameen apna saal 365 din me pura karti hai, wahan Mercury ka saal 88 din ka hai. Faasla sab se kam hai, is liye safar bhi sab se chhota aur raftar bhi sab se zyada, takreeban 47 kilometre fi second. Lekin apne gird ghoomne me ye sust hai, is ka aik din Zameen ke 59 dinon ke barabar hota hai. Ye farq zehen me rakho, paper yahin phansata hai. Sab se tez chakkar Suraj ke gird Mercury ka hai, lekin sab se chhota din Mercury ka nahi, Jupiter ka hai. Wo baat aage ayegi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Mercury ka koi chaand nahi hai. Is ke gird koi faza, yani atmosphere, bhi nahi hai. Isi liye wahan din aur raat ke darja-e-hararat me zameen asmaan ka farq hai. Din ko satah 430 degree tak garam ho jati hai aur raat ko minus 180 degree tak thandi. Faza hoti to garmi ko rok kar rakhti, faza na honay se garmi foran ur jati hai. Paper facts ye hain: sab se chhota siyara, Suraj ke sab se qareeb, sab se tez chakkar, saal sirf 88 din, chaand aik bhi nahi."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Dusra siyara: Venus — Zohra"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Dusra number Venus ka hai, Urdu me Zohra. Ye hamara sab se qareebi parosi siyara hai aur Zameen ki judwa behen kahlata hai, kyunke is ka size aur wazan Zameen se bohat milta julta hai. Lekin tabiyat me ye Zameen se bilkul ulta hai. Venus is pure nizam ka sab se garam siyara hai. Sunne me ajeeb lagega ke Mercury Suraj ke zyada qareeb hai, phir garam Venus kyun? Wajah is ki faza hai. Venus ke gird carbon dioxide gas ki bohat moti aur ghani faza hai jo Suraj ki garmi ko andar to ane deti hai lekin bahar nikalne nahi deti, bilkul us greenhouse ki tarah jisme sabziyan garam mahol me rakhi jati hain. Isi greenhouse effect ki wajah se Venus ki satah ka darja takreeban 465 degree centigrade rehta hai, jo Mercury ke din se bhi zyada hai. Paper ka sab se mashhoor trap yehi hai: sab se qareeb Mercury hai, lekin sab se garam Venus hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Venus asmaan ka sab se chamakdar siyara bhi hai. Subah suraj nikalne se pehle ya sham ko doobne ke baad jo sab se roshan tara nazar ata hai, aksar wahi Venus hota hai. Isi liye ise Bhor ka tara aur Sham ka tara kehte hain, halanke ye tara hai hi nahi, siyara hai. Ab is ki sab se ajeeb baat suno. Venus ulta ghoomta hai, yani baqi siyaron ke bar-aks simt me. Aur apne gird itna ahista ghoomta hai ke is ka aik din is ke pure saal se lamba hai. Apne gird aik chakkar me 243 din, aur Suraj ke gird aik chakkar me 225 din. Yani Venus par din, saal se bara hai. Is ka bhi koi chaand nahi. Paper facts: sab se garam, sab se chamakdar, Zameen ki judwa behen, ulta ghoomta hai, din saal se lamba, chaand koi nahi."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Teesra siyara: Earth — Zameen"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Teesra number hamari apni Zameen ka hai. Aath siyaron me ye wahid siyara hai jahan zindagi mojood hai, aur ye baat is ki har pehchan se bari hai. Ise Neela Siyara kehte hain. Wajah saaf hai, is ki satah ka takreeban 71 feesad hissa pani se dhaka hai, aur khala se dekhne par samandaron ka neela rang sab par ghalib nazar ata hai. Yehi pani, munasib faasla aur saans lene ke qabil faza, teeno cheezain mil kar zindagi ko mumkin banati hain. Zameen Suraj se na itni qareeb hai ke sab kuch jal jaye, na itni door ke sab jam jaye. Is munasib faasle wale hisse ko hi zindagi ke liye mozoon ilaqa samjha jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Zameen Suraj ke gird aik chakkar 365 din aur takreeban 6 ghanton me pura karti hai, yehi hamara aik saal hai, aur un extra ghanton ki wajah se har chaar saal baad February 29 din ka ata hai, jise leap year kehte hain. Apne gird ye 24 ghanton me ghoomti hai, jis se din aur raat bante hain. Zameen apne mehwar par takreeban sadhe 23 degree jhuki hui hai, aur yehi jhukao mausamon ki asal wajah hai. Is ka sirf aik chaand hai, jo raat ke asmaan ki sab se roshan cheez hai. Aik aur dilchasp paper fact ye hai ke Zameen wahid siyara hai jis ka naam kisi devi devta ke naam par nahi rakha gaya, baqi saton ke naam purani tehzeebon ke devtaon par hain. Paper facts: wahid zindagi wala siyara, Neela Siyara, 71 feesad pani, aik chaand, saal 365 din, jhukao sadhe 23 degree."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Chautha siyara: Mars — Mareekh"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Chautha siyara Mars hai, Urdu me Mareekh. Ise duniya bhar me Red Planet, yani Surkh Siyara, kehte hain. Ab wajah samajh lo, kyunke paper wajah wala pehlu bhi parkhta hai. Mars ki satah aur is ki gard me iron oxide ki bharmaar hai. Iron oxide wahi cheez hai jise hum aam zuban me zang kehte hain, jo lohe par lagta hai aur use surkh bhura kar deta hai. Mars ki mitti asal me zang lagi hui mitti hai, is liye poora siyara door se surkh nazar ata hai aur is ki faza me urti gard use surkh asmaan bhi deti hai. Bas ye jumla pakka kar lo: Mars is liye surkh hai kyunke is ki mitti me lohe ka zang, yani iron oxide, mila hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Mars Zameen se chhota hai, is ka saal 687 din ka hota hai, lekin is ka din Zameen ke din jesa hi hai, takreeban sadhe 24 ghante. Is ke do chhote se chaand hain, jin ke naam Phobos aur Deimos hain. Nizam-e-Shamsi ka sab se bara aatish fashan, yani volcano, bhi Mars par hai, jis ka naam Olympus Mons hai, aur wo Zameen ke sab se unche pahar Mount Everest se takreeban dhai guna uncha hai. Mars ke dono qatbon par barf ki safed topiyan bhi mojood hain. Aaj kal ki khabron me Mars is liye rehta hai ke insan wahan pohnchne ki tayyari kar raha hai, aur wahan bheje gaye roboti jahaaz is ki satah par ghum phir kar maloomat bhej rahe hain. Paper facts: Red Planet, wajah iron oxide yani zang, do chaand Phobos aur Deimos, sab se bara aatish fashan Olympus Mons, saal 687 din."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Mars aur Jupiter ke darmiyan patti"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aage barhne se pehle aik zaroori jagah par ruk jao. Mars ke baad Jupiter se pehle, darmiyan me patharon ki aik bohat bari patti hai jise Asteroid Belt kehte hain. Is me lakhon chhote bare pathar Suraj ke gird ghoom rahe hain, jese aik adhoora siyara jo kabhi ban hi na paya ho. Paper me ye sawal ata hai ke Asteroid Belt kin do siyaron ke darmiyan hai, aur jawab hai Mars aur Jupiter. Is patti ke baad jo chaar siyare ate hain wo pehle chaaron se bilkul mukhtalif hain. Pehle chaar chhote aur pathreelay hain, baad wale chaar bohat bare aur gas ke bane hain. Inhen gas ke dev, yani gas giants, kaha jata hai. Ye taqseem bhi zehen me bitha lo: andar wale chaar pathreelay, bahar wale chaar gas wale."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Paanchwa siyara: Jupiter — Mushtari"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paanchwa number Jupiter ka hai, Urdu me Mushtari, aur ye pure Nizam-e-Shamsi ka sab se bara siyara hai. Kitna bara, is ka andaza yun lagao ke is ke andar takreeban 1,300 Zameenein sama sakti hain, aur baqi tamam saath siyaron ko mila lo to bhi Jupiter un sab se zyada wazan rakhta hai. Ye gas ka bana hai, is ki koi thos satah nahi jis par khara hua ja sake."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Jupiter ki sab se mashhoor pehchan is ka Great Red Spot hai, yani Bara Surkh Nishan. Ye asal me aik azeem toofan hai jo is ki faza me soiyon saalon se chal raha hai. Toofan kitna bara hai, suno: is ke andar hamari poori Zameen sama sakti hai. Yani jis cheez ko hum nishan keh rahe hain, wo hamari duniya se bari hai. Ab wo baat jo upar wada ki thi. Jupiter apne gird sab se tez ghoomta hai, is ka din sirf takreeban 10 ghanton ka hai, jo tamam siyaron me sab se chhota din hai. Lekin Suraj ke gird is ka chakkar sust hai, takreeban 12 saal, kyunke faasla bohat zyada hai. Jupiter ke chaandon ki tadaad bhi bohat zyada hai, tasdeeq shuda counts ke mutabiq 95 ke qareeb, aur in me Ganymede sab se khaas hai. Ganymede pure Nizam-e-Shamsi ka sab se bara chaand hai, itna bara ke wo Mercury siyare se bhi bara hai. Paper facts: sab se bara siyara, Great Red Spot aik azeem toofan hai, sab se chhota din takreeban 10 ghante, saal takreeban 12 saal, sab se bara chaand Ganymede."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Chhata siyara: Saturn — Zohal"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Chhata siyara Saturn hai, Urdu me Zohal, aur khubsoorti me is ka koi muqabla nahi. Ise dekhte hi jo cheez nazar ati hai wo is ke gird bane hue roshan chhallay, yani rings, hain. Ye chhallay koi thos plate nahi hai. Ye barf aur pathar ke be-shumar chhote bare tukre hain jo Saturn ke gird chakkar laga rahe hain, aur door se aik khoobsurat thaali ki surat nazar ate hain. In chhallon ki khoobsurati ki wajah se Saturn ko aksar Nizam-e-Shamsi ka sab se khoobsurat siyara kaha jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Saturn Jupiter ke baad dusra sab se bara siyara hai. Aik mazay dar fact ye hai ke ye tamam siyaron me sab se halka hai, is ki kasafat, yani density, pani se bhi kam hai. Agar kahin itna bara samandar mil jaye ke is me Saturn dala ja sake, to ye doobega nahi, terne lagega. Ab sab se aham paper fact. Is waqt ke tasdeeq shuda counts ke mutabiq sab se zyada chaand Saturn ke hain, 146 ke qareeb, aur is hisaab se ye Jupiter se bhi aage hai. Ye wala sawal paper me bar bar ata hai aur bohat se students purani kitabon ki wajah se Jupiter likh ate hain. Tum ye pakka kar lo: sab se zyada chaand Saturn ke hain. Saturn ka aik chaand Titan bhi khaas hai, kyunke us ke gird ghani faza mojood hai. Saturn ka saal takreeban sadhe 29 saal ka hota hai aur is ka din takreeban sadhe 10 ghante ka. Paper facts: khoobsurat chhallay jo barf aur pathar ke tukron se bane hain, dusra sab se bara siyara, sab se halka siyara, sab se zyada chaand, saal takreeban sadhe 29 saal."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Saatwa siyara: Uranus"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Saatwa number Uranus ka hai. Ye wo siyara hai jise leta hua siyara kaha jata hai, aur wajah bohat dilchasp hai. Baqi tamam siyare apne mehwar par takreeban seedhe khare ghoomte hain, jese lattu ghoomta hai. Lekin Uranus takreeban 98 degree jhuka hua hai, yani ye aik taraf ludhka hua hai aur is surat me ghoomta hai jese koi gend ludhakti hui ja rahi ho. Mahireen ka khayal hai ke kisi zamane me kisi bohat bari cheez se takrao ne ise is halat me kar diya hoga. Uranus bhi Venus ki tarah ulta ghoomta hai. Is ka rang halka neela sabz hai, aur ye rang is ki faza me mojood methane gas ki wajah se hai. Ye Suraj se bohat door hai, is liye wahan shadeed thand hoti hai, aur is ki faza me Nizam-e-Shamsi ka sab se kam darja-e-hararat record hua hai, minus 224 degree ke qareeb. Is ka saal takreeban 84 saal ka hota hai, yani jo bacha Uranus ke aik saal pehle paida ho, wo apni pehli salgirah par 84 saal ka hoga. Is ke chaandon ki tadaad 28 ke qareeb hai. Paper facts: leta hua siyara, 98 degree jhukao, halka neela sabz rang methane ki wajah se, ulta ghoomta hai, saal 84 saal."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Aathwa siyara: Neptune"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aathwa aur aakhri siyara Neptune hai. Ye Suraj se sab se door siyara hai, is liye is tak Suraj ki roshni bohat madham ho kar pohnchti hai aur wahan sakht tareen thand hoti hai. Neptune ka rang gehra neela hai, aur ye neela rang bhi is ki faza ki methane ki wajah se hai, bilkul Uranus wali wajah, bas rang us se gehra hai. Ise yaad rakhne ka tareeqa ye hai ke neele rang wale dono behn bhai aakhir me ate hain, pehle halka neela sabz Uranus, phir gehra neela Neptune."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Neptune ki aik aur pehchan is ki tez hawaein hain. Pure Nizam-e-Shamsi ki sab se tez hawaein yahin chalti hain, jin ki raftar 2,000 kilometre fi ghanta se bhi zyada ho sakti hai. Is ka saal tamam siyaron me sab se lamba hai, takreeban 165 saal. Is ka matlab samjho: Neptune 1846 me daryaft hua tha, aur is ne Suraj ke gird apna pehla chakkar 2011 me ja kar pura kiya. Yani daryaft ke baad ise aik saal pura karne me 165 saal lag gaye. Is ke chaandon ki tadaad 16 ke qareeb hai, jin me Triton sab se bara hai. Paper facts: sab se door siyara, gehra neela rang, sab se tez hawaein, sab se lamba saal 165 saal, sab se bara chaand Triton."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Pluto ka kissa"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab aik chhota sa kissa jo paper me zaroor ata hai. Purani kitabon me tumhe nau siyare likhe milenge, aur nauwa naam Pluto hoga. 2006 me duniya bhar ke mahireen ne siyare ki tareef tay ki, aur Pluto us tareef par pura na utra. Tab se Pluto ko siyara nahi, bona siyara, yani dwarf planet, kaha jata hai. Isi liye ab siyare aath hain, nau nahi. Agar paper me sawal aye ke Pluto ko siyaron ki fehrist se kab nikala gaya, to jawab hai 2006. Aur agar kitabon me nau siyare parho to ghabrana nahi, wo 2006 se pehle ki kitabein hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Tartib yaad karne ki trick"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab aath siyaron ki tartib hamesha ke liye zehen me bithane ka tareeqa. Suraj se faasle ki tartib ye hai: Mercury, Venus, Earth, Mars, Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus, Neptune. Ise yaad karne ke liye Angrezi ka aik purana jumla hai: My Very Educated Mother Just Served Us Noodles. Is jumle ke har lafz ka pehla harf hi siyare ka pehla harf hai. My se Mercury, Very se Venus, Educated se Earth, Mother se Mars, Just se Jupiter, Served se Saturn, Us se Uranus aur Noodles se Neptune. Apni ammi ke hath ke noodles wali tasveer bana lo, tartib kabhi nahi bhulegi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aik dusri madad ye hai. Andar wale chaar, yani Mercury, Venus, Earth aur Mars, chhote aur pathreelay hain. Beech me Asteroid Belt hai. Bahar wale chaar, yani Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus aur Neptune, bare aur gas wale hain. Aur size ki tartib alag hai, use faasle wali tartib se mix mat karna. Size me sab se bara Jupiter, phir Saturn, phir Uranus, phir Neptune, phir Zameen, phir Venus, phir Mars, aur sab se chhota Mercury. Paper in dono tartibon ko mila kar phansata hai, tum dono ko alag alag zehen me rakho."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Sab se wali recap — paper ke pakke sawal"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aakhir me wo tamam baatein aik sath dohra lo jin par paper ke sawal bante hain. Sab se bara siyara Jupiter hai. Sab se chhota siyara Mercury hai. Suraj ke sab se qareeb Mercury hai. Sab se door Neptune hai. Sab se garam siyara Venus hai, greenhouse effect ki wajah se. Sab se chamakdar siyara bhi Venus hai, Bhor ka tara. Surkh siyara Mars hai, mitti ke zang, yani iron oxide, ki wajah se. Zindagi wala wahid siyara Zameen hai, Neela Siyara. Sab se zyada chaand Saturn ke hain. Sab se bara chaand Jupiter ka Ganymede hai. Sab se chhota din Jupiter ka hai, takreeban 10 ghante. Sab se lamba saal Neptune ka hai, 165 saal, aur sab se chhota saal Mercury ka, 88 din. Sab se khoobsurat chhallay Saturn ke hain. Leta hua siyara Uranus hai. Sab se tez hawaein Neptune ki hain. Aur sab ke markaz me Suraj hai, jo siyara nahi, sitara hai. Agar ye recap tumhe bina dekhe sunai ja sake, to samjho Nizam-e-Shamsi ke sawal tumhare pakke ho gaye."),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/visual-notes/planets.jpg", caption: "The Solar System — Sun and eight planets"),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/visual-notes/planets.jpg", caption: "Sab Se Chart — biggest, hottest, farthest, most moons"),
    ],
  ),
  GeoTopic(
    id: "atmosphere",
    title: "Zameen ka Ghilaaf — Atmosphere aur us ki Layers",
    subtitle: "Hawa ka wo samandar jisme hum sab rehte hain, aik aik layer ke sath",
    portion: "space",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.heading("Ye topic kyun zaroori hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Dekho, one paper ke Everyday Science aur GK hisse me atmosphere aik fix topic hai. Layers ki tartib, kis layer me kya hota hai, ozone kahan hai, ozone hole kyun bana, Montreal Protocol kab hua — ye sawal har paper me ghum phir kar ate hain. Khushkhabri ye hai ke ye topic mushkil bilkul nahi hai. Bas aik tasveer zehen me bitha lo ke zameen ke upar hawa ki paanch tehain (layers) hain, aur har teh ka apna aik khaas kaam hai. Tartib aur har layer ki pehchan pakki ho jaye to ye number kahin nahi jate."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Atmosphere hai kya"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Zameen ke chaaron taraf lapeta hua gaso ka ghilaaf hi atmosphere hai. Asaan misaal se samjho. Jese sardi me tum kambal orhte ho aur kambal tumhe bahar ki thand se bachata hai, bilkul wese hi zameen ne hawa ka aik bohat bara kambal orha hua hai. Farq sirf itna hai ke ye kambal sirf thand se nahi bachata, ye zindagi ki har zaroorat poori karta hai. Zameen ki kashish (gravity) is hawa ko pakre hue hai, warna ye kab ki space me ur gayi hoti."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is hawa me hai kya. Sab se zyada nitrogen hai, taqreeban 78 feesad. Doosre number par oxygen hai, taqreeban 21 feesad, yehi wo gas hai jo hum sans me lete hain. Baqi aik feesad me argon, carbon dioxide, pani ke bukharat aur dusri gasain shamil hain. Yahan pehla paper wala trap samajh lo. Zyada tar students samajhte hain ke hawa me sab se zyada oxygen hai, lekin asal me sab se zyada nitrogen hai. Ye sawal bar bar ata hai, pakka yaad rakho."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Atmosphere kyun zaroori hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pehli wajah sans hai. Oxygen ke baghair insaan, janwar, koi zinda cheez jee nahi sakti, aur poday (plants) carbon dioxide le kar khana banate hain aur oxygen wapas dete hain. Ye lena dena atmosphere ke andar hi hota hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Dusri wajah kambal wala kaam hai. Atmosphere din ki garmi ka kuch hissa rok kar zameen ko na bohat garam hone deta hai na raat ko bohat thanda. Agar ye ghilaaf na hota to din me jhulsane wali garmi aur raat me jama dene wali sardi hoti. Chaand ki misaal samne hai. Chaand par atmosphere nahi hai, is liye wahan din aur raat ke darja hararat me soin (hundreds) degree ka farq par jata hai. Zameen par ye farq is ghilaaf ki wajah se bohat kam hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Teesri wajah hifazat hai. Suraj ki khatarnak ultraviolet roshni ko ozone wali teh rok leti hai, jis ki tafseel aage arahi hai. Aur space se girne wale chhote pathar (meteor) bhi isi hawa me jal kar khatam ho jate hain, zameen tak bohat kam pohanchte hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Chauthi wajah mausam hai. Badal, barish, barf, hawa ka chalna, ye sab atmosphere ke andar hota hai. Pani ka pura chakkar, samandar se bukharat uthna, badal banna, barish girna, isi ghilaaf ki badaulat hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aik aakhri baat zehen me rakho. Atmosphere ki koi wazeh kinara wali sarhad nahi hai. Neeche hawa ghani (dense) hai aur upar jate jate patli hoti jati hai, hatta ke ahista ahista space me ghul jati hai. Atmosphere ki zyada tar hawa zameen ke qareeb pehle chand kilometre ke andar hi hai. Aam taur par 100 kilometre ki bulandi ko space ki shuruaat mana jata hai, isay Karman Line kehte hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Layers ki tartib pehle yaad kar lo"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Scientists ne darja hararat ke badalne ke andaaz ki bunyad par atmosphere ko paanch layers me baanta hai. Neeche se upar ki tartib ye hai. Troposphere, Stratosphere, Mesosphere, Thermosphere aur Exosphere. Ionosphere koi alag layer nahi hai, wo Thermosphere ke andar ka aik khaas charged hissa hai, us ki baat Thermosphere ke sath hi ayegi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Tartib yaad karne ki trick ye hai. Ye jumla ratt lo: Tum Se Mila Tha Eid par. Tum yani Troposphere, Se yani Stratosphere, Mila yani Mesosphere, Tha yani Thermosphere aur Eid yani Exosphere. Bas, tartib kabhi nahi bhulegi. Ab har layer ko aik aik karke samajhte hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Troposphere"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Ye zameen se sab se qareeb, sab se neeche wali layer hai. Is ka naam Greek lafz tropos se aya hai jis ka matlab hai badlao ya milawat (mixing), aur is layer me hawa lagatar milti aur badalti rehti hai. Ye layer zameen ki satah se shuru ho kar taqreeban 12 kilometre ki bulandi tak jati hai. Khutut-e-istawa (equator) ke upar ye 16 se 18 kilometre tak unchi hai aur poles par sirf 8 kilometre ke qareeb hai, kyunke garam ilaaqon me hawa phail kar zyada upar tak jati hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is layer ka sab se bara kaam ye hai ke saara mausam yahin hota hai. Badal, barish, barfbaari, aandhi, toofan, bijli kadakna, jo kuch bhi mausam ke naam par hota hai wo sab Troposphere ke andar hota hai. Wajah samajh lo. Pani ke bukharat taqreeban sare ke sare isi layer me hain aur hawa bhi yahin sab se ghani hai, to badal aur barish ka saara samaan yahin mojood hai. Atmosphere ki kul hawa ka taqreeban teen chauthai hissa, yani 75 feesad se zyada, isi chhoti si layer ke andar samaaya hua hai. Insaan, janwar, parinde, hatta ke duniya ki sab se unchi choti Mount Everest (taqreeban 8.8 kilometre) bhi isi layer ke andar hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab wo baat jo paper me sab se zyada ati hai. Is layer me bulandi ke sath darja hararat ghatta hai. Har aik kilometre upar jane par darja hararat taqreeban 6.5 degree Celsius kam ho jata hai, isay lapse rate kehte hain. Wajah bari asaan hai. Suraj ki roshni pehle zameen ko garam karti hai, phir garam zameen apne qareeb wali hawa ko garam karti hai. Bilkul wese jese tawa pehle garam hota hai phir roti ko garam karta hai. To jo hawa zameen ke sab se qareeb hai wo sab se garam, aur jese jese upar jao garam karne wale taway se doori barhti jati hai aur thand barhti jati hai. Isi liye paharon ki chotiyon par barf parti hai aur Murree jesi jagahen maidanon se thandi hoti hain. Is layer ki upar wali sarhad ko Tropopause kehte hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper ki pehchan wali baat ye hai ke saara mausam Troposphere me hota hai aur bulandi ke sath darja hararat ghatta hai. Aur haan, lambi parwaz wale jahaaz mausam ki kharabiyon se bachne ke liye taqreeban 10 se 12 kilometre ki bulandi par urte hain, yani is layer ke bilkul aakhir me, jahan se agli layer shuru hoti hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Stratosphere"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Ye Troposphere ke upar wali dusri layer hai, taqreeban 12 kilometre se 50 kilometre tak. Is layer ki sab se khaas baat ye hai ke yahan darja hararat ka hisaab ulta ho jata hai. Yahan bulandi ke sath darja hararat ghatne ke bajaye barhta hai. Wajah aage arahi hai, ozone. Ozone Suraj ki ultraviolet roshni ko jazb karti hai aur is amal se ye layer upar ki taraf garam hoti jati hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is layer me hawa bohat pur-sukoon (calm) hai. Yahan na badal bante hain, na barish hoti hai, na aandhi chalti hai, kyunke pani ke bukharat yahan taqreeban nahi hote. Yehi wajah hai ke lambi parwaz wale jahaaz is layer ke neeche wale hisse me urna pasand karte hain. Mausam ki koi kharabi nahi, hawa ke jhatke nahi, safar hamvaar aur pursukoon rehta hai aur fuel bhi kam lagta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Isi layer me wo cheez hai jis ki wajah se zameen par zindagi mehfooz hai, yani OZONE LAYER. Ozone gas ki ye teh taqreeban 15 se 35 kilometre ki bulandi ke darmiyan phaili hai aur sab se ghani 20 se 30 kilometre ke aas paas hai. Ozone ki puri tafseel is file ke aakhir me alag se di gayi hai, kyunke ye one paper ka sab se pasandeeda topic hai. Is layer ki upar wali sarhad ko Stratopause kehte hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper ki pehchan wali baat ye hai ke ozone layer Stratosphere me hai. Ye jumla har doosre paper me kisi na kisi surat me ata hai. Aur dusri pehchan ye ke jahaaz Stratosphere me is liye urte hain kyunke wahan mausam nahi hota."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Mesosphere"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Ye darmiyan wali, teesri layer hai, taqreeban 50 kilometre se 85 kilometre tak. Mesos ka matlab hi darmiyan hai. Ye atmosphere ki sab se thandi layer hai. Yahan darja hararat dobara ghatna shuru ho jata hai aur is layer ke sab se upar ja kar taqreeban minus 90 degree Celsius tak gir jata hai, jo pure atmosphere ka sab se kam darja hararat hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is layer ka kaam zameen ki hifazat hai, lekin dusre andaaz me. Space se jo chhote pathar aur gard ke zaray (meteor) zameen ki taraf ate hain, wo is layer me tez raftaar se hawa se ragar khate hain, garam ho kar jal uthte hain aur aksar yahin khatam ho jate hain. Raat ko asmaan me jo roshni ki lakeer aik lamhe ke liye chamak kar gayab ho jati hai, jise awam tootta sitara kehte hain, wo asal me yehi meteor hai jo Mesosphere me jal raha hota hai. Meteor ki puri tafseel Space Objects wale topic me milegi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aik mazay ki baat ye hai ke ye layer scientists ke liye sab se mushkil hai. Jahaaz aur mausami ghubare (weather balloons) itni bulandi tak ja nahi sakte, aur satellites ke liye yahan hawa phir bhi itni hai ke wo yahan tik nahi sakte. Is liye is layer ko sab se kam explore kiya gaya hai. Is ki upar wali sarhad ko Mesopause kehte hain aur yehi atmosphere ka sab se thanda nuqta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper ki pehchan wali baat ye hai ke meteor Mesosphere me jalte hain aur sab se thandi layer Mesosphere hai. Dono baatein fix sawal hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Thermosphere aur Ionosphere"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Ye chauthi layer hai, taqreeban 85 kilometre se 600 kilometre tak. Thermo ka matlab hai garmi, aur is naam ki wajah ye hai ke yahan darja hararat bohat zyada barh jata hai, hazaar degree Celsius se bhi upar napajata hai. Lekin ghabrane ki baat nahi. Yahan hawa itni patli hai ke gas ke zaray bohat door door hain, is liye itna zyada darja hararat honay ke bawajood koi cheez yahan aam maano me garam mehsoos nahi karti. Darja hararat zarayon ki raftaar ka naam hai, aur jab zaray hi na honay ke barabar hon to garmi ka asar bhi na honay ke barabar hota hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab Ionosphere ko samjho, ye is file ka aik aur paper wala hissa hai. Thermosphere ke andar, aur Mesosphere ke upar wale hisse me, Suraj ki tez roshni hawa ke zarayon ko charge (ionize) kar deti hai. Is charged hisse ko Ionosphere kehte hain. Is ka sab se bara kaam radio waves ko wapas morna hai. Zameen se bheji gayi radio waves jab Ionosphere se takrati hain to aainay se takra kar wapas ane ki tarah zameen ki taraf lot ati hain. Yehi wajah hai ke radio signals aik sheher se dusre mulk tak, samandaron ke paar tak, pohanch jate hain. Agar Ionosphere na hota to lambay faasle ki radio communication bohat mushkil ho jati."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Isi layer me wo roshni wala tamasha bhi hota hai jise Aurora kehte hain. Poles ke qareeb raat ko asmaan me sabz, surkh aur jamni rang ki leherti roshniyan nazar ati hain. Ye Suraj se ane wale charged zarayon ke hawa se takrane se banti hain. North Pole ki taraf wali ko Aurora Borealis aur South Pole ki taraf wali ko Aurora Australis kehte hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aik aur aham baat. Insaan ki banayi hui sab se bari space station, International Space Station yani ISS, taqreeban 400 kilometre ki bulandi par isi layer me zameen ke gird ghoomti hai. Aur space ki mashhoor sarhad, Karman Line (100 kilometre), bhi isi layer ke neeche wale hisse se guzarti hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper ki pehchan wali baat ye hai ke radio waves Ionosphere se reflect ho kar wapas ati hain, aur ISS Thermosphere me hai. Ye dono jumle rat lo."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Exosphere"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Ye atmosphere ki sab se aakhri, sab se bahar wali layer hai. Ye taqreeban 600 kilometre se shuru hoti hai aur hazaron kilometre tak, taqreeban 10,000 kilometre tak, phaili hui hai, aur phir ahista ahista khala (space) me ghul jati hai. Is ki koi wazeh kinara wali sarhad nahi hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Yahan hawa khatam honay ke barabar hai. Sirf sab se halki gaso, hydrogen aur helium, ke chand zaray bohat door door mojood hain. Kuch zaray itne door nikal jate hain ke wo zameen ki kashish se nikal kar space me chale jate hain. Samajh lo ke ye wo jagah hai jahan atmosphere khamoshi se khatam hota hai aur asal space shuru hota hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is layer ki pehchan ye hai ke zyada tar masnooi satellites (artificial satellites) isi layer aur is ke aas paas ke orbital ilaqay me zameen ke gird ghoomte hain. Mausam batane wale satellites, communication satellites, GPS satellites, sab inhi bulandiyon par apne apne orbit me hain. Masnooi satellites ki tafseel Space Objects wale topic me hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper ki pehchan wali baat ye hai ke sab se bahar wali layer Exosphere hai aur satellites Exosphere me hote hain. Aur tartib aik dafa phir dohra lo: Troposphere, Stratosphere, Mesosphere, Thermosphere, Exosphere — Tum Se Mila Tha Eid par."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Ozone — Zameen ki dhaal, aur us me surakh"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab us cheez ki tafseel jo is pure topic ka sab se zyada poocha jane wala hissa hai, yani ozone. Pehle matlab samjho. Ozone oxygen ki aik khaas shakal hai. Aam oxygen, jo hum sans me lete hain, us ke har molecule me do atom hote hain, use O2 kehte hain. Ozone ke molecule me teen atom hote hain, use O3 kehte hain. Ye halki neeli (pale blue) rang ki gas hai aur is ki boo tez hoti hai. Bijli kadakne ke baad hawa me jo ajeeb si boo ati hai, wo bijli se bani hui thori si ozone hi ki hoti hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ozone banti kese hai. Stratosphere me Suraj ki ultraviolet roshni jab aam oxygen (O2) ke molecule se takrati hai to use tor kar alag alag atom bana deti hai. Phir yehi atom kisi dusre O2 molecule se jud jata hai aur O3 yani ozone ban jati hai. Ye tootne aur banne ka amal lagatar chalta rehta hai, aur is amal ke doran ultraviolet roshni jazb (absorb) hoti rehti hai. Yehi jazb hona hi hamari hifazat hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ozone ka kaam kya hai. Ozone layer Suraj se ane wali khatarnak ultraviolet, yani UV, rays ka taqreeban 97 se 99 feesad hissa rok leti hai. Ye koi chhoti baat nahi hai. Agar ye UV roshni seedhi zameen tak pohanchti to insaanon me jild ka cancer barh jata, ankhon me motia (cataract) aam ho jata, faslon ki paidawar kam ho jati, samandar ki satah ke qareeb rehne wali chhoti zindagi tabah ho jati aur insaan ke jism ki bimariyon se ladne ki taqat (immunity) kamzor par jati. Isi liye ozone ko zameen ki dhaal aur zindagi ka sun-screen kaha jata hai. Aur yaad rakho, ye ozone Stratosphere me hai, taqreeban 15 se 35 kilometre ki bulandi par."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab ozone hole ki baat. Hole ka matlab asal surakh nahi hai. 1980 ki dahayi me scientists ne dekha ke Antarctica, yani South Pole wale bar-e-azam, ke upar har saal wahan ki bahar (spring) ke mausam me, September se November ke darmiyan, ozone bohat patli ho jati hai. Is patle honay ko hi ozone hole kaha jata hai. Ye baat paper me is liye ati hai ke sawal poochta hai ozone hole kahan hai, aur sahi jawab Antarctica hai, Arctic ya North Pole nahi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Hole bana kyun. Is ki sab se bari wajah CFC hai, jis ka pura naam chlorofluorocarbons hai. Ye chemicals purane zamane ke fridge, air conditioner, spray cans aur foam banane me aam istemal hote the. CFC ke molecules bohat dair tak kharab nahi hote, wo ahista ahista upar Stratosphere tak pohanch jate hain. Wahan tez UV roshni unhe torti hai aur un me se chlorine nikalta hai. Ye chlorine ozone ke molecules ko tor tor kar khatam karta hai. Aur sab se khatarnak baat ye hai ke chlorine ka aik atom is amal me khud khatam nahi hota, wo taqreeban aik lakh ozone molecules ko tor sakta hai. Isi liye thori si CFC bhi bohat bara nuqsan karti hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Phir duniya ne kya kiya. Is masle ka hal Montreal Protocol hai, aur ye one paper ka sab se fix sawal hai. 16 September 1987 ko Canada ke sheher Montreal me duniya bhar ke mulkon ne aik muahide par dastakhat kiye ke ozone ko nuqsan pohanchane wale chemicals, khaas taur par CFC, ahista ahista band kar diye jayenge. Ye muahida 1989 se nafiz hua aur itna kamyab raha ke ise duniya ke sab se kamyab maholiyati (environmental) muahidon me gina jata hai. CFC ka istemal taqreeban khatam ho chuka hai aur scientists ke mutabiq ozone layer ahista ahista theek ho rahi hai. Isi 16 September ko har saal duniya bhar me Ozone Day, yani International Day for the Preservation of the Ozone Layer, manaya jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baatein aakhir me aik sath dohra lo. Ozone Stratosphere me hai aur us ke molecule me teen oxygen atom hain. Ozone hole Antarctica ke upar banta hai. Us ki wajah CFC hai. Montreal Protocol 1987 me Canada ke sheher Montreal me hua. Aur 16 September Ozone Day hai. Ye paanch baatein pakki kar lo, in me se koi na koi har paper me mojood hoti hai."),
    ],
  ),
  GeoTopic(
    id: "space-objects",
    title: "Asmaan ki Cheezain — Star, Comet, Galaxy aur baqi",
    subtitle: "Har cheez pehle hai kya, phir us ki pehchan kya hai",
    portion: "space",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.heading("Ye topic kyun zaroori hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Dekho, one paper ke Everyday Science hisse me asmaan wala hissa har saal ata hai. Mushkil ye nahi ke sawal sakht hote hain, mushkil ye hai ke alfaaz bohat milte julte hain. Meteor, meteorite, asteroid, comet — student in me ulajh kar number kata deta hai. Is liye is topic me hum har cheez ko aik hi tartib se parhenge. Pehle matlab, ye cheez hai kya. Phir pehchan, paper me ya asmaan me use pehchanna kese hai. Aur aakhir me wo baat jo paper me sawal banti hai. Tartib ye zehen me bitha lo to ye uljhane wale alfaaz hamesha ke liye sulajh jayenge."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Sitara (Star)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Sitara garam gaso ka aik bohat bara gola hai jo apni roshni aur apni garmi khud banata hai. Is ke andar sab se zyada hydrogen hoti hai, us ke baad helium. Sitare ke markaz me dabao aur garmi itni shadeed hoti hai ke wahan nuclear fusion hota hai, yani hydrogen ke atom jud jud kar helium bante hain aur is amal se bohat bari miqdar me roshni aur garmi bahar nikalti hai. Bas yehi roshni lakho kilometre ka safar karke hum tak pohanchti hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pehchan ye hai. Sitare raat ko timtimate (twinkle) nazar ate hain. Mazay ki baat ye hai ke timtimana sitare ka kaam nahi hai, ye hamari atmosphere ki karistani hai. Sitare ki roshni jab hawa ki tehno se guzarti hai to bar bar terhi hoti hai, is liye humein lagta hai ke sitara jhapak raha hai. Sitaron ka rang bhi un ki garmi batata hai. Neelay sitare sab se garam hote hain, safed darmiyan me, aur laal sitare sab se thande."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Suraj hamara sab se qareebi sitara hai. Ye jumla itna ata hai ke ab to isay GK ki bunyad samjho. Aur Suraj ke baad sab se qareebi sitara Proxima Centauri hai, jo taqreeban 4.2 light year door hai. Light year kya hai, wo aage isi topic me araha hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Siyara (Planet)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Siyara wo jism hai jo kisi sitare ke gird aik muqarrar raaste me ghoomta hai, jise orbit kehte hain, aur us ki apni koi roshni nahi hoti. Wo sitare ki roshni ko reflect karke chamakta hai. Planet lafz ka matlab bhi bhatakne wala hai, kyunke purane zamane ke log dekhte the ke ye roshniyan baqi sitaron ke muqable me asmaan me apni jagah badalti rehti hain. Asal me wo sitare nahi, hamare apne nizam ke siyare the jo Suraj ke gird ghoomte hue idhar udhar hote dikhte the."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pehchan sitare se farq me hai, aur ye farq paper ka pasandeeda hai. Siyare timtimate nahi hain. Un ki roshni mustaqil (steady) rehti hai. Wajah ye hai ke siyare hum se bohat qareeb hain aur humein aik nuqte ki bajaye aik chhoti si gol shakal (disc) ki surat me dikhte hain, is liye un ki roshni hawa me utni nahi bikhar ti. To usool yaad rakho: timtimaye to sitara, mustaqil chamke to siyara ho sakta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Hamare nizam-e-shamsi (solar system) me aath siyare hain. Jupiter sab se bara siyara hai, Mercury Suraj ke sab se qareeb hai aur Neptune sab se door. Venus sab se zyada chamakne wala hai, use subah ka sitara aur sham ka sitara kaha jata hai, lekin naam ke bawajood wo sitara nahi, siyara hai — yehi paper ka trap hai. Aur Pluto ko 2006 me siyaron ki list se nikal kar dwarf planet (chhota siyara) kar diya gaya tha, is liye siyare nau nahi, aath hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Qudrati Satellite (Chaand)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Jo jism kisi siyare ke gird ghoomta hai, use us siyare ka satellite kehte hain, aur jo satellite qudrat ne banaya ho use qudrati (natural) satellite kehte hain. Zameen ka qudrati satellite sirf aik hai, aur wo hamara Chaand hai. Dusre siyaron ke chaand bohat zyada hain, masalan Saturn ke 140 se zyada chaand maloom ho chuke hain, lekin zameen ke hisse me sirf aik aya hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Chaand ki asal baatein ye hain. Chaand zameen se taqreeban 3 lakh 84 hazar kilometre door hai aur zameen ke gird aik chakkar taqreeban 27.3 din me pura karta hai. Is ki apni roshni koi nahi, ye Suraj ki roshni reflect karke chamakta hai. Aik khaas baat ye hai ke Chaand apne mehwar (axis) par ghoomne me bhi utna hi waqt leta hai jitna zameen ke gird chakkar me, yani 27.3 din. Is pur-asrar barabari ki wajah se hum zameen se hamesha Chaand ki aik hi taraf dekhte hain, dusri taraf hamesha hum se chhupi rehti hai. Aur Chaand ki kashish hi samandaron me madd-o-jazr (tides) paida karti hai, yani pani ka charhna aur utarna."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Chaand par pehla qadam rakhne wala insaan Neil Armstrong tha, 20 July 1969 ko, Apollo 11 mission me. Ye GK ka sab se mashhoor sawalon me se aik hai. Aur ye bhi yaad rakho ke Chaand par atmosphere nahi hai, is liye wahan na awaaz safar kar sakti hai na mausam hota hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Masnooi Satellite (Artificial Satellite)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Masnooi ka matlab hai insaan ka banaya hua. To masnooi satellite wo machine hai jo insaan ne bana kar rocket ke zariye space me pohanchai, aur ab wo zameen ke gird aik muqarrar orbit me ghoom rahi hai. Qudrati satellite qudrat ne banaya, masnooi satellite insaan ne — bas yehi dono ka bunyadi farq hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("In ka kaam kya hai, ye samjho to satellite kabhi nahi bhulega. Communication satellites TV channels, mobile phone aur internet ke signals ko aik jagah se dusri jagah pohanchate hain. Weather satellites badalon aur toofanon ki tasveerein bhej kar mausam ki peshangoi mumkin banate hain, sailab aur samandari toofan ki warning inhi ki wajah se pehle mil jati hai. GPS satellites tumhare mobile ko batate hain ke tum is waqt khare kahan ho. Is ke ilawa zameen ki nigrani karne wale satellites faslon, janglon, barf aur sheheron ki tabdeeli par nazar rakhte hain aur science ki research ke satellites alag hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baatein teen hain aur teeno fix hain. Duniya ka pehla masnooi satellite Sputnik 1 tha, jo Soviet Union (maujooda Russia) ne 4 October 1957 ko space me bheja. Pakistan ka pehla satellite Badr-1 tha, jo 1990 me China ki madad se bheja gaya. Aur Pakistan ki space agency ka naam SUPARCO hai, jo 1961 me bani thi. SUPARCO ka pura naam hai Space and Upper Atmosphere Research Commission. Sputnik ka 1957, SUPARCO ka 1961 aur Badr-1 ka 1990, ye teen saal apni jagah pakke kar lo."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Dum-daar Sitara (Comet)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Comet barf, gard (dust) aur pathar ke tukron ka bana hua aik gola hai jo Suraj ke gird bohat lambe, ande ki shakal wale (elliptical) orbit me ghoomta hai. Scientists isay aksar ganda barf ka gola, yani dirty snowball, kehte hain, kyunke asal me ye jami hui gaso, barf aur mitti pathar ka mila jula dhair hai. Urdu me isay dum-daar sitara kehte hain, lekin naam ke bawajood ye sitara nahi hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pehchan is ki dum hai, aur dum ka qissa hi asal concept hai. Jab comet apne lambe orbit me ghoomte hue Suraj ke qareeb ata hai to Suraj ki garmi se is ki barf bhaap ban kar urne lagti hai. Is ke gird roshni wala dhundla sa ghilaaf banta hai jise coma kehte hain, aur peeche ki taraf aik lambi chamakti dum (tail) nikal ati hai jo lakhon kilometre lambi ho sakti hai. Ab sab se aham baat, jo paper ka mashhoor trap hai. Dum hamesha Suraj se ulti simt (opposite direction) me hoti hai. Comet Suraj ki taraf ja raha ho ya Suraj se door wapas ja raha ho, dum har haal me Suraj ke opposite hi rahegi, kyunke Suraj ki roshni aur Suraj se ane wali hawa (solar wind) use peeche dhakelti rehti hai. Dum peeche ki taraf is liye nahi hoti ke comet aage barh raha hai, dum Suraj se door is liye hoti hai ke Suraj use dhakel raha hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Sab se mashhoor comet Halley ka comet hai. Ye har taqreeban 76 saal ke baad wapas nazar ata hai. Aakhri dafa ye 1986 me nazar aya tha aur agli dafa 2061 me ayega. Is ka naam scientist Edmond Halley ke naam par hai, jis ne is ke purane zahoor ka hisaab laga kar is ki wapsi ki peshangoi ki thi. 76 saal, 1986 aur 2061, ye teen number Halley ke sath jor kar yaad rakho."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Asteroid"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Asteroid Suraj ke gird ghoomne wale chhote pathreele jism hain. Ye asal me wo pathar aur dhat (metal) ke tukre hain jo nizam-e-shamsi ke bante waqt siyare na ban sake aur yunhi ghoomte reh gaye. In ki koi tay shuda gol shakal nahi hoti, aksar ye be-tarteeb, aalu jaisi shakal ke hote hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pehchan aur jagah ye hai. Zyada tar asteroids aik patti (belt) ki surat me Mars aur Jupiter ke darmiyan ghoomte hain, isay Asteroid Belt kehte hain. Comet se farq yahan pakka kar lo. Asteroid pathar aur dhat ka hota hai, comet barf ka hota hai. Asteroid ki koi dum nahi hoti, comet ki dum hi us ki pehchan hai. Ye do farq paper me bar bar ate hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Asteroid Belt Mars aur Jupiter ke darmiyan hai, ye jumla ratt lo. Aur sab se bara asteroid Ceres hai, jise ab dwarf planet bhi kaha jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Meteor (Tootta Sitara, Shooting Star)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Space se ane wala koi chhota sa pathar ya gard ka zarra jab zameen ki atmosphere me bohat tez raftaar se dakhil hota hai to hawa ki shadeed ragar (friction) se garam ho kar jal uthta hai aur asmaan me aik lamhe ke liye roshni ki lakeer si ban jati hai. Bas yehi jalti hui lakeer meteor hai. Awam isay tootta sitara ya shooting star kehte hain, lekin naam ke bawajood is ka sitaron se koi taluq nahi. Koi sitara nahi tootta, aik chhota sa zarra jalta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pehchan aur kaam ye hai. Zyada tar meteors itne chhote hote hain ke wo atmosphere ki Mesosphere layer me hi jal kar raakh ho jate hain aur zameen tak pohanchte hi nahi. Jese Atmosphere wale topic me parha tha, ye layer zameen ki hifazati dhaal ka kaam karti hai. Kabhi kabhi aik sath bohat se meteors nazar ate hain, jese asmaan se roshni ki barish ho rahi ho, use meteor shower kehte hain. Ye tab hota hai jab zameen kisi comet ke chhore hue gard ke badal se guzarti hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Shooting star asal me sitara nahi hota, ye jumla statement wale sawal me ata hai. Aur meteor ka jalna atmosphere me hota hai, space me nahi."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Meteorite"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Jo meteor itna bara ho ke atmosphere me pura na jale aur bach kar zameen ki satah tak pohanch jaye, use meteorite kehte hain. Ye zameen par gir kar kabhi kabhi aik bara garha (crater) bhi bana deta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab teeno ka farq aik sath samajh lo, kyunke ye silsila paper ka sab se pasandeeda hai. Aik hi pathar ke teen marahil hain aur har marhale ka naam alag hai. Jab wo pathar space me ghoom raha ho to use meteoroid kehte hain. Jab wo atmosphere me dakhil ho kar jalti hui lakeer banaye to wo meteor hai. Aur jab wo bach kar zameen par gir jaye to wo meteorite ban jata hai. Tartib is jumle se yaad rakho: space wala meteoroid, jala to meteor, gira to meteorite."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Duniya ke mashhoor craters me America ke Arizona ka Meteor Crater hai. Aur aik bohat mashhoor GK baat ye bhi hai ke taqreeban 6 crore 60 lakh saal pehle aik bare asteroid ya meteorite ke zameen se takrane ko hi dinosaurs ke khatam honay ki sab se bari wajah mana jata hai. Wo takrao Mexico ke ilaqe me hua tha."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Galaxy (Kahkashan)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Galaxy sitaron ka aik bohat bara sheher hai. Karoron aur arbon sitaron, un ke siyaron, gas aur gard ka wo wasee majmua jo kashish (gravity) ki wajah se aik sath bandha hota hai, galaxy kahlata hai. Aam galaxy me 100 arab (100 billion) se zyada sitare hote hain, aur har sitare ke gird us ke apne siyare ho sakte hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Hamari galaxy ka naam Milky Way hai, Urdu me use Kahkashan kehte hain. Kisi saaf aur andheri raat me asmaan me jo safed dhundli si patti aik kinare se dusre kinare tak phaili dikhti hai, wo hamari apni galaxy hi hai jise hum andar se, kinare ki taraf se, dekh rahe hote hain. Hamara Suraj is galaxy ke arbon sitaron me se sirf aik aam darjane ka sitara hai. Milky Way ki shakal spiral hai, yani ghumao-daar, jese ghoomta hua chakkar."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Hamari sab se qareebi bari galaxy Andromeda hai, jo taqreeban 25 lakh light year door hai. Aur pure universe me arbon galaxies hain, har galaxy me arbon sitare. Sawal aksar is tartib se ata hai ke Suraj kis galaxy me hai, jawab Milky Way hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Universe (Kainat)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Jo kuch bhi mojood hai, sab ka sab universe hai. Tamam galaxies, tamam sitare, tamam siyare, khala, waqt, roshni, energy, har cheez ka kul majmua universe kahlata hai. Is se bahar ki koi cheez is tareef me nahi ati, kyunke universe ka matlab hi sab kuch hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Aaj ki science ke mutabiq universe taqreeban 13.8 arab saal pehle aik bohat hi chhote aur ghane nuqte se aik bare dhamake se shuru hua, is nazariye ko Big Bang kehte hain. Tab se universe lagatar phail raha hai aur galaxies aik dusre se door ja rahi hain. Big Bang aur phailta hua universe, ye dono baatein fix sawal hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Light Year (Noori Saal)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai, aur pehle is topic ka sab se bara trap samajh lo. Light year waqt ki ikai nahi hai, faasle ki ikai hai. Ye wo faasla hai jo roshni pure aik saal me tay karti hai. Naam me saal honay ki wajah se bohat se students use waqt samajh lete hain, aur paper bilkul yehi trap lagata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Hisab is tarah hai. Roshni duniya ki sab se tez cheez hai, wo aik second me taqreeban 3 lakh kilometre chalti hai. Ab socho, jo cheez aik second me 3 lakh kilometre jati hai, wo pure saal me kitna jayegi. Jawab hai taqreeban 9.46 trillion kilometre, yani saade nau hazar arab kilometre se bhi zyada. Bas yehi aik light year hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is ka kaam ye hai ke asmaan ke faasle itne bare hain ke aam kilometre me likhne se number sambhalta nahi. Is liye light year istemal hota hai. Do misaalein zehen me bitha lo. Suraj ki roshni zameen tak pohanchne me taqreeban 8 minute lagti hai, is ka matlab hai ke hum Suraj ko hamesha 8 minute purani halat me dekh rahe hote hain. Aur sab se qareebi sitara Proxima Centauri 4.2 light year door hai, yani us ki roshni ko hum tak ane me 4.2 saal lagte hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Light year faasle ki ikai hai, waqt ki nahi. Aur roshni ki raftaar 3 lakh kilometre per second hai. Ye do baatein har doosre paper me ghumti hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Black Hole"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Black hole khala me wo jaga hai jahan kashish (gravity) itni shadeed hai ke koi cheez wahan se bahar nahi nikal sakti, hatta ke roshni bhi nahi. Isi liye ye kala hai. Jo cheez roshni bahar hi nahi ane deti, wo nazar kese ayegi. Scientists use seedha dekh nahi sakte, us ke aas paas ki cheezon ke bartao se pehchante hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Banta kese hai. Jab koi bohat bara sitara apni zindagi ke aakhir me apna fuel khatam kar deta hai to wo apne hi wazan ke neeche andar ki taraf dhas (collapse) jata hai. Agar sitara bohat bara ho to ye dhasna black hole par ja kar rukta hai. Us ke gird aik sarhad hoti hai jise event horizon kehte hain. Us sarhad ke andar jo gaya, us ki wapsi mumkin nahi, roshni ki bhi nahi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Har bari galaxy ke markaz me aik bohat bara, supermassive, black hole hota hai. Hamari Milky Way ke markaz wale black hole ka naam Sagittarius A Star hai. Aur kisi black hole ki pehli asal tasveer 2019 me li gayi thi, jo M87 galaxy ke markaz ke black hole ki thi. Ye haal hi ke saalon ka mashhoor GK sawal hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Suraj Grehan (Solar Eclipse)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Grehan ka matlab hai kisi roshni wali cheez ka chhup jana. Suraj grehan tab hota hai jab Chaand ghoomte hue Suraj aur Zameen ke darmiyan a jata hai. Chaand Suraj ki roshni ko rok leta hai, zameen ke kuch hisse par Chaand ka saya par jata hai aur din ke waqt kuch dair ke liye andhera sa chha jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Kab hota hai. Sirf naye chaand, yani new moon, wale din, jab Suraj, Chaand aur Zameen aik seedh me ajayein. Lekin har naye chaand par grehan nahi hota, kyunke Chaand ka orbit zara sa terha hai, is liye aksar Chaand ka saya zameen ke upar ya neeche se guzar jata hai. Grehan usi din hota hai jab teeno bilkul seedh me hon."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is ki qismein bhi samajh lo. Kul grehan (total eclipse) me Suraj pura chhup jata hai aur din ke waqt asmaan me sitare nazar ane lagte hain. Juzwi grehan (partial) me Suraj ka sirf aik hissa chhupta hai. Aur aik qism me Chaand zameen se door honay ki wajah se chhota dikhta hai, to wo Suraj ke markaz ko chhupata hai lekin kinaron par roshni ki aik angothi (ring) reh jati hai, use annular eclipse kehte hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Suraj grehan me darmiyan me Chaand hota hai, ye position pakki yaad rakho. Aur suraj grehan ko nangi ankh se dekhna ankhon ke liye khatarnak hai, ye bhi sawal banta hai. Khaas glasses ke baghair seedha Suraj ki taraf grehan ke doran bhi nahi dekhna chahiye."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Chaand Grehan (Lunar Eclipse)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Chaand grehan tab hota hai jab Zameen Suraj aur Chaand ke darmiyan a jati hai. Ab Zameen ka saya Chaand par parta hai, aur Chaand, jo Suraj ki roshni se chamakta tha, madham ho jata hai. Farq sirf darmiyan wali cheez ka hai. Suraj grehan me darmiyan me Chaand tha, chaand grehan me darmiyan me Zameen hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Kab hota hai. Sirf pure chaand, yani full moon, wali raat ko, jab teeno aik seedh me hon. Chaudhvin ke chaand wali raat hi chaand grehan ki raat ho sakti hai, is ke ilawa nahi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aik khaas baat ye hai ke kul chaand grehan me bhi Chaand pura gayab nahi hota. Zameen ki atmosphere se chhan kar aur mur kar ane wali halki laal roshni Chaand tak pohanch jati hai, is liye grehan wala Chaand aksar gehra laal ya tambay (copper) jaisa rang le leta hai. Isay Blood Moon kaha jata hai. Aur suraj grehan ke bar-aks, chaand grehan ko nangi ankh se dekhna bilkul mehfooz hai. Chaand grehan ghanto tak chal sakta hai aur jahan raat ho wahan ke bare hisse se aik sath dikhta hai, jabke suraj grehan chhote ilaqe me sirf chand minute ka hota hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Dono grehanon ka asal sawal position ka hai. Suraj grehan: Suraj, Chaand, Zameen. Chaand grehan: Suraj, Zameen, Chaand. Aur waqt ka farq bhi yaad rakho, suraj grehan naye chaand par, chaand grehan pure chaand par."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Chaand ki Shaklain (Phases of the Moon)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai, aur yahan aik mashhoor ghalat fehmi pehle door kar lo. Chaand apni shakel asal me badalta hi nahi. Badalta sirf ye hai ke us ka roshan hissa humein kitna aur kis taraf se nazar ata hai. Chaand Suraj ki roshni reflect karta hai. Jab wo zameen ke gird ghoomta hai to kabhi us ka roshan hissa pura hamari taraf hota hai, kabhi aadha, aur kabhi bilkul hamari taraf nahi hota. Bas yehi badlao chaand ki shaklain kahlata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Tartib ye hai. Pehle naya chaand ata hai, jab roshan hissa bilkul hum se ulti taraf hota hai aur chaand nazar hi nahi ata. Phir patla sa hilal (crescent) dikhta hai — Eid ka chaand yehi hilal hai. Phir aadha chaand banta hai, phir roshan hissa barhta jata hai, aur aakhir me pura chaand (full moon) chamakta hai, jise chaudhvin ka chaand kehte hain. Is ke baad roshan hissa isi tartib se ghatna shuru ho jata hai, hatta ke dobara naya chaand a jata hai. Ye pura chakkar taqreeban 29.5 din ka hai, aur yehi qamri (lunar) maheena hai. Ramzan, Eidain aur islami tareekhain isi cycle se tay hoti hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Chaand ki shaklain zameen ke saye ki wajah se nahi banti. Saya wali baat chaand grehan ki hai, jo saal me kabhi kabhar hota hai, jabke shaklain har maheene badalti hain aur un ki wajah Chaand ka zameen ke gird ghoomna aur Suraj ki roshni ka zawiya (angle) hai. In do cheezon ko mix karna paper ka mashhoor trap hai, is se bachna."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Aakhir me farq wali joriyan dohra lo"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aakhir me wo joriyan aik sath rakh kar yaad kar lo jin me paper phansata hai. Sitara apni roshni khud banata hai aur timtimata hai, siyara roshni reflect karta hai aur mustaqil chamakta hai. Comet barf ka hai aur us ki dum hoti hai, asteroid pathar ka hai aur us ki koi dum nahi hoti. Meteor wo hai jo atmosphere me jala, meteorite wo hai jo bach kar zameen par gira. Qudrati satellite qudrat ne banaya jese Chaand, masnooi satellite insaan ne banaya jese Badr-1. Aur light year waqt nahi, faasla hai. Ye paanch joriyan pakki ho jayein to asmaan wala hissa tumhara pakka ho gaya."),
    ],
  ),
];

const List<PlanetSection> planetSections = <PlanetSection>[
  PlanetSection(
    id: "sun",
    name: "Sun",
    urduName: "Suraj",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Sab se pehli aur sab se pakki baat. Suraj siyara nahi hai, sitara hai. Ye hamare Nizam-e-Shamsi ke bilkul darmiyan me hai aur baqi tamam siyare is ke gird chakkar lagate hain. Is ki wajah is ka hajm hai. Pure Nizam-e-Shamsi ke kul wazan ka takreeban tamam hissa, yani 99.86 feesad, akelay Suraj me hai. Baqi aath siyare, un ke chaand, pathar aur gard, sab mil kar bhi aik feesad se kam bante hain. Yehi wajah hai ke Suraj ki kashish sab ko apne gird bandhe rakhti hai, jese aik bara markaz apne chhote sathiyon ko sambhale rakhta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Suraj kitna bara hai, is ka andaza yun lagao. Is ka qutar takreeban 13 lakh 90 hazar kilometre hai, yani Zameen ke qutar se takreeban 109 guna bara. Agar Suraj ko khokhla ghubaara samjho to is ke andar takreeban 13 lakh Zameenein sama sakti hain. Ye aisi misaal hai jo paper me bhi ati hai aur zehen me bhi reh jati hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab sawal ye hai ke Suraj itna garam aur roshan kyun hai. Is ke markaz me hydrogen gas shadeed dabao se helium me badalti rehti hai, aur is amal me bohat zyada tawanai banti hai jo roshni aur garmi ki surat me bahar nikalti hai. Isi liye Suraj ke markaz ka darja-e-hararat takreeban dedh crore degree centigrade hai, jabke is ki satah ka darja takreeban 5,500 degree hai. Suraj ki roshni ko Zameen tak pohnchne me takreeban 8 minute aur 20 second lagte hain. Yani tum jo Suraj dekh rahe ho, wo asal me 8 minute purana manzar hai. Suraj ki umar takreeban 4 arab 60 crore saal hai, aur Zameen par zindagi ki buniyad hi is ki roshni aur garmi hai. Paper ke liye ye lines pakki kar lo: Suraj aik sitara hai, Nizam-e-Shamsi ka markaz hai, sab se bara hissa hai, aur is ki roshni 8 minute se zyada waqt me hum tak pohnchti hai."),
    ],
  ),
  PlanetSection(
    id: "mercury",
    name: "Mercury",
    urduName: "Utarid",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Suraj se sab se qareeb siyara Mercury hai, jise Urdu me Utarid kehte hain. Ye Nizam-e-Shamsi ka sab se chhota siyara hai, itna chhota ke hamare Chaand se bas thora sa bara hai. Aur ye sab se tez siyara bhi hai. Tez se murad ye hai ke Suraj ke gird is ka chakkar sab se jaldi pura hota hai, sirf 88 din me. Socho, jahan Zameen apna saal 365 din me pura karti hai, wahan Mercury ka saal 88 din ka hai. Faasla sab se kam hai, is liye safar bhi sab se chhota aur raftar bhi sab se zyada, takreeban 47 kilometre fi second. Lekin apne gird ghoomne me ye sust hai, is ka aik din Zameen ke 59 dinon ke barabar hota hai. Ye farq zehen me rakho, paper yahin phansata hai. Sab se tez chakkar Suraj ke gird Mercury ka hai, lekin sab se chhota din Mercury ka nahi, Jupiter ka hai. Wo baat aage ayegi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Mercury ka koi chaand nahi hai. Is ke gird koi faza, yani atmosphere, bhi nahi hai. Isi liye wahan din aur raat ke darja-e-hararat me zameen asmaan ka farq hai. Din ko satah 430 degree tak garam ho jati hai aur raat ko minus 180 degree tak thandi. Faza hoti to garmi ko rok kar rakhti, faza na honay se garmi foran ur jati hai. Paper facts ye hain: sab se chhota siyara, Suraj ke sab se qareeb, sab se tez chakkar, saal sirf 88 din, chaand aik bhi nahi."),
    ],
  ),
  PlanetSection(
    id: "venus",
    name: "Venus",
    urduName: "Zohra",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Dusra number Venus ka hai, Urdu me Zohra. Ye hamara sab se qareebi parosi siyara hai aur Zameen ki judwa behen kahlata hai, kyunke is ka size aur wazan Zameen se bohat milta julta hai. Lekin tabiyat me ye Zameen se bilkul ulta hai. Venus is pure nizam ka sab se garam siyara hai. Sunne me ajeeb lagega ke Mercury Suraj ke zyada qareeb hai, phir garam Venus kyun? Wajah is ki faza hai. Venus ke gird carbon dioxide gas ki bohat moti aur ghani faza hai jo Suraj ki garmi ko andar to ane deti hai lekin bahar nikalne nahi deti, bilkul us greenhouse ki tarah jisme sabziyan garam mahol me rakhi jati hain. Isi greenhouse effect ki wajah se Venus ki satah ka darja takreeban 465 degree centigrade rehta hai, jo Mercury ke din se bhi zyada hai. Paper ka sab se mashhoor trap yehi hai: sab se qareeb Mercury hai, lekin sab se garam Venus hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Venus asmaan ka sab se chamakdar siyara bhi hai. Subah suraj nikalne se pehle ya sham ko doobne ke baad jo sab se roshan tara nazar ata hai, aksar wahi Venus hota hai. Isi liye ise Bhor ka tara aur Sham ka tara kehte hain, halanke ye tara hai hi nahi, siyara hai. Ab is ki sab se ajeeb baat suno. Venus ulta ghoomta hai, yani baqi siyaron ke bar-aks simt me. Aur apne gird itna ahista ghoomta hai ke is ka aik din is ke pure saal se lamba hai. Apne gird aik chakkar me 243 din, aur Suraj ke gird aik chakkar me 225 din. Yani Venus par din, saal se bara hai. Is ka bhi koi chaand nahi. Paper facts: sab se garam, sab se chamakdar, Zameen ki judwa behen, ulta ghoomta hai, din saal se lamba, chaand koi nahi."),
    ],
  ),
  PlanetSection(
    id: "earth",
    name: "Earth",
    urduName: "Zameen",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Teesra number hamari apni Zameen ka hai. Aath siyaron me ye wahid siyara hai jahan zindagi mojood hai, aur ye baat is ki har pehchan se bari hai. Ise Neela Siyara kehte hain. Wajah saaf hai, is ki satah ka takreeban 71 feesad hissa pani se dhaka hai, aur khala se dekhne par samandaron ka neela rang sab par ghalib nazar ata hai. Yehi pani, munasib faasla aur saans lene ke qabil faza, teeno cheezain mil kar zindagi ko mumkin banati hain. Zameen Suraj se na itni qareeb hai ke sab kuch jal jaye, na itni door ke sab jam jaye. Is munasib faasle wale hisse ko hi zindagi ke liye mozoon ilaqa samjha jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Zameen Suraj ke gird aik chakkar 365 din aur takreeban 6 ghanton me pura karti hai, yehi hamara aik saal hai, aur un extra ghanton ki wajah se har chaar saal baad February 29 din ka ata hai, jise leap year kehte hain. Apne gird ye 24 ghanton me ghoomti hai, jis se din aur raat bante hain. Zameen apne mehwar par takreeban sadhe 23 degree jhuki hui hai, aur yehi jhukao mausamon ki asal wajah hai. Is ka sirf aik chaand hai, jo raat ke asmaan ki sab se roshan cheez hai. Aik aur dilchasp paper fact ye hai ke Zameen wahid siyara hai jis ka naam kisi devi devta ke naam par nahi rakha gaya, baqi saton ke naam purani tehzeebon ke devtaon par hain. Paper facts: wahid zindagi wala siyara, Neela Siyara, 71 feesad pani, aik chaand, saal 365 din, jhukao sadhe 23 degree."),
    ],
  ),
  PlanetSection(
    id: "mars",
    name: "Mars",
    urduName: "Mareekh",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Chautha siyara Mars hai, Urdu me Mareekh. Ise duniya bhar me Red Planet, yani Surkh Siyara, kehte hain. Ab wajah samajh lo, kyunke paper wajah wala pehlu bhi parkhta hai. Mars ki satah aur is ki gard me iron oxide ki bharmaar hai. Iron oxide wahi cheez hai jise hum aam zuban me zang kehte hain, jo lohe par lagta hai aur use surkh bhura kar deta hai. Mars ki mitti asal me zang lagi hui mitti hai, is liye poora siyara door se surkh nazar ata hai aur is ki faza me urti gard use surkh asmaan bhi deti hai. Bas ye jumla pakka kar lo: Mars is liye surkh hai kyunke is ki mitti me lohe ka zang, yani iron oxide, mila hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Mars Zameen se chhota hai, is ka saal 687 din ka hota hai, lekin is ka din Zameen ke din jesa hi hai, takreeban sadhe 24 ghante. Is ke do chhote se chaand hain, jin ke naam Phobos aur Deimos hain. Nizam-e-Shamsi ka sab se bara aatish fashan, yani volcano, bhi Mars par hai, jis ka naam Olympus Mons hai, aur wo Zameen ke sab se unche pahar Mount Everest se takreeban dhai guna uncha hai. Mars ke dono qatbon par barf ki safed topiyan bhi mojood hain. Aaj kal ki khabron me Mars is liye rehta hai ke insan wahan pohnchne ki tayyari kar raha hai, aur wahan bheje gaye roboti jahaaz is ki satah par ghum phir kar maloomat bhej rahe hain. Paper facts: Red Planet, wajah iron oxide yani zang, do chaand Phobos aur Deimos, sab se bara aatish fashan Olympus Mons, saal 687 din."),
