      LessonBlock.paragraph("Chhata siyara Saturn hai, Urdu me Zohal, aur khubsoorti me is ka koi muqabla nahi. Ise dekhte hi jo cheez nazar ati hai wo is ke gird bane hue roshan chhallay, yani rings, hain. Ye chhallay koi thos plate nahi hai. Ye barf aur pathar ke be-shumar chhote bare tukre hain jo Saturn ke gird chakkar laga rahe hain, aur door se aik khoobsurat thaali ki surat nazar ate hain. In chhallon ki khoobsurati ki wajah se Saturn ko aksar Nizam-e-Shamsi ka sab se khoobsurat siyara kaha jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Saturn Jupiter ke baad dusra sab se bara siyara hai. Aik mazay dar fact ye hai ke ye tamam siyaron me sab se halka hai, is ki kasafat, yani density, pani se bhi kam hai. Agar kahin itna bara samandar mil jaye ke is me Saturn dala ja sake, to ye doobega nahi, terne lagega. Ab sab se aham paper fact. Is waqt ke tasdeeq shuda counts ke mutabiq sab se zyada chaand Saturn ke hain, 146 ke qareeb, aur is hisaab se ye Jupiter se bhi aage hai. Ye wala sawal paper me bar bar ata hai aur bohat se students purani kitabon ki wajah se Jupiter likh ate hain. Tum ye pakka kar lo: sab se zyada chaand Saturn ke hain. Saturn ka aik chaand Titan bhi khaas hai, kyunke us ke gird ghani faza mojood hai. Saturn ka saal takreeban sadhe 29 saal ka hota hai aur is ka din takreeban sadhe 10 ghante ka. Paper facts: khoobsurat chhallay jo barf aur pathar ke tukron se bane hain, dusra sab se bara siyara, sab se halka siyara, sab se zyada chaand, saal takreeban sadhe 29 saal."),
